;; Layers for the uml-viewer diagram (target/uml/veil.edn), mirroring
;; docs/architecture.md and ModuleDependencyTest: engine packages sit below
;; ui, and ui sits below Main. Groups are ordered inner (index 0) to outer;
;; the viewer draws a dependency from an inner group to an outer one red.
;; Package names are the segments under com.swiftfaze.veil; a root-package
;; class is its kebab-case name (Main -> main). sandbox is dev-only UI tooling,
;; so it shares the ui level. This file never adds a rule ArchUnit lacks.
{:hierarchical true
 :title "Veil"
 :prefix "com.swiftfaze.veil"
 :levels [[game world mods entities]
          [ui sandbox]
          [main]]}
